ai/
generate-intro-email : 
    takes data of client, match, compatibilityScore, reasons(optional)
    uses llama-3.3-70b-instruct model to generate email
    responds with emailSubject and emailBody

auth/
login:
    takes email and password as data
    creates token using jwt and stores in cookie
    responds with `matchmaker = {
            id: matchmaker.id,
            name: matchmaker.name,
            designation: matchmaker.designation,
            initials: matchmaker.initials
        }`

clients/
add:
    takes client data
    adds a new client to clients.json
    responds with the new client data

/:
    takes optional query params: search, stage, sortBy, page, limit
    gets clients assigned to the logged-in matchmaker
    responds with paginated list of clients

/:id:
    takes client id
    gets a client by id
    responds with the client data

/:id/stage:
    takes client id and stage
    updates the stage of a client
    responds with the updated client data

/:id/notes:
    (POST) takes client id and note content
    adds a new note for a client
    responds with the new note

    (GET) takes client id
    gets all notes for a client
    responds with a list of notes

/:id/matches:
    takes client id
    gets potential matches for a client
    responds with a list of matches and compatibility scores

/:id/matches/:matchId/send:
    takes client id, match id, emailSubject, and emailBody
    sends a match to a client
    responds with success message and match record

dashboard/
stats:
    gets dashboard statistics for the logged-in matchmaker
    responds with activeClients, matchesSentThisMonth, currentlyDating, closedMatched

matches/
history:
    gets match history for the logged-in matchmaker
    responds with a list of sent matches

